# The structure with a hole in its risk profile. Sell the ~25-delta put,
# sell the ~25-delta call, buy a call five points above the short one.
# If the total credit collected exceeds the width of that call spread,
# there is no upside risk at all: the spread's worst case is already
# paid for. The downside is a naked short put and stays undefined, which
# is why the management lines are not decoration.
#
# Sold into rich premium, because the whole trade is a bet that implied
# volatility is dearer than what follows.
strategy "Jade Lizard on SPY"

universe $SPY

when [ivrank] > 40
  write [jade_lizard delta=25 width=5 dte=45]

close at [profit 50%]
  or [dte 21]

risk [contracts 1]
